  {
    "type": "tall-left",
    "page": "motor_30",
    "head": { "title": { "en": "MOTOR", "zh": "电机" }, "small": "motor_30" },
    "variant": "hero",
    "figures": [
      { "src": "motor_30_pulley_exploded_cam1_wcny.svg" },
      { "src": "motor_30_pulley_assembled_cam0_ghfe.svg" }
    ],
    "notes": [
      {
        "h3": { "en": "Two heights", "zh": "不同高度" },
        "body": { "en": "The A and B belts sit at different heights: Motor A's pulley (left) is coplanar with the lower idlers, Motor B's pulley (right) coplanar with the upper idlers. Slide each pulley along its motor shaft into position, then lock it down with the set screw.", "zh": "A、B 两条同步带高度不同：电机 A 的同步轮（左）与下层惰轮共面，电机 B 的同步轮（右）与上层惰轮共面。同步轮沿电机轴滑到位，再用紧定螺钉锁紧。" },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:40mm; top:15mm; width:90mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": { "en": "Set screws", "zh": "紧定螺钉" },
        "body": { "en": "Tighten one set screw onto the shaft's D-flat first, then tighten the other.", "zh": "先把一颗紧定螺钉对准 D 形切面拧紧，再拧紧另一颗。" },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:142mm; top:30mm; width:42mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": { "en": "Threadlocker", "zh": "螺纹胶加固" },
        "body": { "en": "<p>Apply threadlocker to every set screw. A loose pulley throws off motion accuracy and is the single most common issue users report. Before you do, though, make sure the pulleys and idlers are aligned. You can also hold off on the threadlocker and apply it after the belts are installed.</p>", "zh": "<p>每颗紧定螺钉都要涂螺纹胶。同步轮松动会导致运动失准，是用户反馈最多的问题。涂胶前务必对齐同步轮和惰轮。也可以等装好同步带后再涂。</p>" },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:140mm; top:110mm; width:80mm;"
      }
    ],
    "bom": {
      "label": { "en": "Bill of materials", "zh": "物料清单" },
      "rows": [
        { "component": { "en": "Pulley", "zh": "同步轮" }, "spec": { "en": "GT2 20T, 6 mm", "zh": "GT2 20T，6 mm" }, "qty": "2" }
